                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="472 2357 472 2369 987 2369 1112 2379 1114 2379 1116 2379 1118 2379 1133 2369 1243 2369 1298 2379 1300 2379 1425 2367 1705 2377 1707 2377 1709 2377 1711 2377 1725 2365 1747 2375 1748 2375 1750 2375 1752 2375 1792 2365 1817 2375 1819 2375 1821 2375 1886 2365 2115 2375 2117 2375 2119 2375 2121 2375 2134 2363 2134 2350 2128 2312 1300 2324 1008 2316 1006 2316 883 2326 487 2318 485 2318 483 2318 481 2318 470 2324 472 2357"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Once when I was travelling with a party of Chukchee in the country of"/>
                    </TextLine>

